<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0715_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Krise</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You...\nYou think I’m fine, right?\fI can tell. Everybody does.\rSo how ’bout we swap numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t trip, you can call me anytime!\nI know you will. You can’t help it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, I see...\nMaybe I was overthinkin’...\fNah. You’ll be back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I KNEW it! I KNEW you thought I was\nfine!\rSo, shall we swap numbers now? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You must be REAL shy.\nIf you nearby, come talk to me in\fperson. It’s aight. I don’t bite.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My prized {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} doin’ great.\rWhich homie you like best?\nYou should show me sometime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, listen up!\nYesterday we fought a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rI used a Hennessy at the WRONG moment,\nand it looked like we gon’ lose.\fI drank half of it. My bad.\rMy homie went SO hard!\nWell, stuff like that happen, I guess.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You keep all the homies you catch in\nPC Boxes?\rMe, I usually just let ’em go...\nI’m a catch-and-release kinda girl.\rI recently let a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} go...\nThat’s kinda a waste, ain’t it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, what you think about scrappin’\nme again?\rI’m at the {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}\nright now.\rC’mon over!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup?\nYou remember your promise?\rWe gotta scrap soon!\nI’ll be at the {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0715_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It wasn’t real smart to come to the\nPark in a miniskirt, was it...?\rThese leaves keep scratchin’ my legs...\fBut I look GOOD though.</language>
	</row>
</body>
